DI_BAPopupVerifiedPurchaser\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_BAInsidePopup\"><div class=\"BVDIBody BVDI_BAPopupBody\"><dl class=\"BVDI_BAList\"><dt class=\"BVDI_BAItem BVDI_BAItemOnly BVDI_BAItemVerifiedPurchaser\">\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/dt><dd><p>Customer has been confirmed to have purchased the item from Walmart.<\/p><\/dd><\/dl><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\" id=\"BVDI_BABadge_e0gry73htz1xrxbliplriiclk_ID\"onmouseover=\"bvTooltip.show(&quot;BVDI_BAPopup_la2yq5txomh5f7tfzauy97532_ID&quot;, this.id, false, []);\"onmouseout=\"bvTooltip.hide();\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n <div class=\"BVRRCustomUserInfoContainer\">\n<div class=\"BVRRContextDataContainer\"><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"5 out of 5\" title=\"5 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">5<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">18 inch wild badger lawn mower<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">05/27/2026<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2026-05-27\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReview426884959_dlm608ijcjsg8z61emhv9g2ql_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">Fantastic mower. So easy to push and does a great cut. One of the top ten items I have ever bought. <br />I love it!!<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"BVDI_FV\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVVoting BVDI_FVVotingHelpfulness\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVSum BVDI_FVSumHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDI_FVZero BVDI_FVLevel1\"><span class=\"BVDIValue BVDINumber\">0<\/span><span class=\"BVDISuffix\">points<\/span><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVCounts BVDI_FVCountsHelpfulness\"><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVVotes BVDI_FVVotesHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">Was this helpful?<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel1\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/5319348630/review/426884959/positive.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format=embeddedhtml&amp;innerreturn=https%3A%2F%2Fwalmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com%2F1336%2F5319348630%2Freviews.djs%3Fformat%3Dembeddedhtml%26num%3D100%26sort%3DsubmissionTime&amp;return=__R